=Generator=
*  Health: 8
*  Price: %Minerals% 40
*  [[concepts/scanning range|Scanning range]]: 2
*  Consumes: %Fuel%10
*  Produces: %Energy%20
Enabled generators provide energy for the local [[concepts/compound]]. Since many structures consume %Energy% when enabled, generators are a crucial component of any active base. Combine with [[units/structures/reactor core]]s for increased output.
